---
// Short editorial statement — the old site's "De Clientes a Fãs da Marca"
// section, without turning it into a fabricated testimonials band (no
// case studies are published yet — see PerformanceCard.astro's own note
// on candor about results). Light section (the whole site stays light for
// now — a dark mode toggle is planned separately later), leaning on a
// bordered card and the orange accent for weight instead of a dark bg.
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-nv-offwhite-light py-24 sm:py-28">
  <img
    src="/images/mark-nuvion.png"
    alt=""
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 top-1/2 h-[360px] w-[360px] -translate-y-1/2 object-contain opacity-[0.035] sm:h-[480px] sm:w-[480px]"
  />

  <div class="nv-reveal-up relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 sm:px-10">
    <div class="rounded-[32px] border border-nv-hairline bg-white p-8 shadow-[0_20px_56px_rgba(20,20,20,.06)] sm:p-14">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-nv-orange sm:text-sm">Além da entrega</span>

      <p class="nv-h1 mt-6 text-pretty text-[26px] text-nv-graphite-900 sm:text-[38px]">
        Um bom resultado não aparece só no número de vendas.{" "}
        <strong>Aparece na confiança que faz o cliente voltar, indicar a Nuvion e crescer junto com a marca.</strong>
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-6 border-t border-nv-hairline pt-8 sm:flex-row sm:gap-10">
        <p class="max-w-md text-pretty text-base leading-[1.62] text-nv-graphite-600">
          Por isso pensamos cada entrega para durar: tecnicamente, com uma arquitetura que não fica velha em seis
          meses, e na relação, com dados abertos e um acompanhamento contínuo de verdade.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap content-start gap-2.5 sm:justify-end">
          <span class="rounded-full border border-nv-hairline bg-nv-offwhite-light px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-nv-graphite-700">
            Foco no resultado
          </span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-nv-hairline bg-nv-offwhite-light px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-nv-graphite-700">
            Transparência estratégica
          </span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-nv-hairline bg-nv-offwhite-light px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-nv-graphite-700">
            Expertise humana e tecnologia
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll(".nv-reveal-up").forEach((el) => {
    if (window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches) {
      el.classList.add("is-visible");
      return;
    }
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => {
        for (const entry of entries) {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) {
            el.classList.add("is-visible");
            observer.disconnect();
          }
        }
      },
      { threshold: 0.4 },
    );
    observer.observe(el);
  });
</script>
